# License scope — approval pending

This is a private publication staging candidate. No project-wide permission grant is effective from these draft materials until the rights holders and exact scope are confirmed by Human and recorded in COPYRIGHT.md.

Proposed: original software MIT; authorized original research documents, model contributions and research data/media CC BY 4.0. The complete unmodified license forms are in LICENSES/MIT.txt and LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt. Their generic placeholders are not assertions of ownership.

Third-party material retains its own license and notices regardless of project approval. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and release-assets/R2_LICENSE_SCOPE.csv. No blanket grant covers upstream assets, excluded datasets or rights not held by the licensors.
